    "description": "The other day, when I put up a post on Rape, I've got so many messages about it. For every one idiot who thinks that talking about rape is useless, there are thousands of people who wish who could do something about it and bring a change. I was stuck for a while thinking about this and just did my very little research on the existing apps for women's safety. What I've realized is that although there is atleast one new app coming every year, there are not a lot of people who are aware and the apps can't be monetizable which was the main concern. ⁣\n⁣\nThe draft idea which is explained above is not random and I am still thinking about the possibilities, features, selling points & add ons. The wireframes explained above are for basic understanding of how the application would work. The wireframes are basic so you could also come up with better features / selling points or any number of ways to monetize & market the app.⁣\n⁣\nAs much as I would hate to see cute nibbas & nibbis commenting 'Anna, intha chesinodivi nuvve app develop cheyochu ga', I would like to reply in advance 'Hanumanthudu sahayame chesthadu, Raamude yuddham cheyali'.⁣\n⁣\nOn a serious note, I would love to see this app working out. Let's  all encourage the intent of the post and forward it to 'relevant' & interested people and let's get someone to start working on this. ⁣\n⁣\nOn a practically note, irrespective of an app's presence or not, we should be more brave & willing to help anyone in need.\n\n#fakemuchatlu Jai Hind. - FM",
